  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed as a suru verb ({新設|しんせつ}する) or as a noun modifier ({新設|しんせつ}の). The homophone {親切|しんせつ} (kindness) is a completely different word.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {学校|がっこう}を{新設|しんせつ}する: to newly establish a school\n- {新設|しんせつ}{部門|ぶもん}: newly created department\n- {新設|しんせつ}{校|こう}: newly built school\n- {新設|しんせつ}{合併|がっぺい}: new merger\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {設立|せつりつ}: establishment, founding (more general)\n- {創設|そうせつ}: founding, creation (emphasizes being the first)",
